# Beacon Saddle (CIPlay beacon_saddle): the saddle plateau at 4 m (round 0 0); the beacon, the pilgrims' log, the radio
# hut chest, the tower chest, the bearing card, the radio set (used twice: the second use is refused).
island Beacon Saddle
offset 0 0
expect step 0
expect title The Last Beacon
zone beacon
expect step 1
read Pilgrims' log
expect step 2
open Radio hut
wait 3
expect step 3
open Beacon tower
wait 3
expect step 4
read Bearing card
expect step 5
open Cave chest
wait 3
expect step 6
read Mail plane log
expect step 7
read Keeper's last page
expect step 8
open Keeper's strongbox
expect message wants three numbers
code keeperpad 147 wrong
code keeperpad 741
open Keeper's strongbox
wait 3
expect story raft-Tangaroa_KeyCard 1
expect step 9
use radioset
expect story pulse 1
use radioset
expect story pulse 1
expect done
